                    'empty_copy' => __('Assign recruiter and hiring-manager contacts to active HR Contact Groups to preview people-led hiring feeds here.', 'senna-finance'),
		                    'aria' => __('Hiring contact groups', 'senna-finance'),
			                ],
			            ];
            $normalize_filter_location = static function ($location) {
                $label = trim(preg_replace('/\s+/', ' ', (string) $location));
                if ($label === '') {
                    return ['', ''];
                }

                $normal = strtolower($label);
                $normal = str_replace(['u.a.e.', 'u.a.e', 'united arab emirates'], 'uae', $normal);
                $normal = str_replace(['kingdom of saudi arabia', 'ksa'], 'saudi arabia', $normal);

                $canonical_locations = [
                    'london' => ['london-uk', 'London, UK'],
                    'paris' => ['paris-france', 'Paris, France'],
                    'milan' => ['milan-italy', 'Milan, Italy'],
                    'amsterdam' => ['amsterdam-netherlands', 'Amsterdam, Netherlands'],
                    'dubai' => ['dubai-uae', 'Dubai, UAE'],
                ];

                foreach ($canonical_locations as $city => $canonical) {
                    if (strpos($normal, $city) !== false) {
                        return $canonical;
                    }
                }

                if (strpos($normal, 'uae') !== false) {
                    return ['uae', 'UAE'];
                }

                if (strpos($normal, 'saudi arabia') !== false) {
                    return ['saudi-arabia', 'Saudi Arabia'];
                }

                return [sanitize_title($label), $label];
            };
            $filter_locations = [];
            foreach ($group_sets as $group_set) {
                foreach ((array) ($group_set['groups'] ?? []) as $filter_group) {
                    $location_candidates = [];
                    $group_location = trim((string) ($filter_group['location'] ?? ''));
